            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A system comprising: power sourcing equipment comprising: a power supply; and a plurality of ports each configured for transmitting Power over Ethernet, PoE, at a power of at least 100 watts; and a plurality of power interface modules, each of the power interface modules comprising: a plurality of ports for communication with a group of the ports at the power sourcing equipment; and an alternating current, AC, outlet delivering combined power received at the ports.</p>
